    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game contains flashing lights that may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Players with a history of these conditions should use caution and consider consulting a physician before playing. Player discretion is advised.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chilling first-person horror game, you are plunged into complete darkness. To navigate the eerie surroundings, you must speak into your microphone, using sound waves to create a temporary visual representation of your environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205820/extras/8fc645eba6718dfa39653681ba364e48.poster.avif?t=1729242289\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205820/extras/8fc645eba6718dfa39653681ba364e48.webm?t=1729242289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205820/extras/8fc645eba6718dfa39653681ba364e48.mp4?t=1729242289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, a terrifying creature lurks in the shadows, drawn to the sound of your voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205820/extras/cb6109da6f9165c3bb94c39a4ca20631.poster.avif?t=1729242289\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205820/extras/cb6109da6f9165c3bb94c39a4ca20631.webm?t=1729242289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205820/extras/cb6109da6f9165c3bb94c39a4ca20631.mp4?t=1729242289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can you outsmart the monster and escape the deadly game of cat and mouse, or will you be left screaming in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Entertaining gameplay with exciting challenges and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Original graphics and visual effects that create immersion in the world of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use of microphone for Unique \u201cSound Navigation\u201d feature that allows players to navigate the environment using voice and sound waves to create a temporary visual representation of the surroundings</p>",
