b6109da6f9165c3bb94c39a4ca20631.mp4?t=1729242289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can you outsmart the monster and escape the deadly game of cat and mouse, or will you be left screaming in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Entertaining gameplay with exciting challenges and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Original graphics and visual effects that create immersion in the world of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use of microphone for Unique \u201cSound Navigation\u201d feature that allows players to navigate the environment using voice and sound waves to create a temporary visual representation of the surroundings</p>",
